00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:21.670
Egaita yume tsukamu no wa
I know that realizing dreams

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:27.420
Kantan janaitte wakatteru kedo
Is not an easy thing to accomplish, but

00:22:27.630 --> 00:22:32.630
Saisho kara muri datte dakyou shiteru
Those who say it's impossible from the beginning

00:22:32.630 --> 00:22:37.960
Hito no me hikari wa mienai
Can't see light with their eyes

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:43.500
Miageru sora no kousei tachi wa
Up above in the sky are the fixed stars

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:48.710
Itsumo inochi o moyashite hikatteru
That always shine bright with life

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:50.830
Boku ni datte
I can, too

00:22:50.960 --> 00:22:55.130
Taiyou runner kokoro o kanzen nenshou
Taiyou runner with a heart burning at maximum

00:22:55.130 --> 00:23:01.290
Goal e kakumei no hikari hanatsu yo
Radiating the light of revolution towards the goal

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:07.420
Last rei byou sore made kekka nante wakaranai sa
Nobody can know the outcome until the very last second

00:23:07.710 --> 00:23:14.080
Akireru hodo onore o koete hashiritsuzukeru yo
I'll keep on running and improving until I don't recognize myself

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:16.790
Step 1! Shouri o mark shite
Step 1! Focus on winning

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:19.420
Step 2! Image wakasete
Step 2! Imagine the future

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:24.880
Step 3! Tada zenryoku de penerate
Step 3! Just penetrate through at full power

